WEBVTT

00:03:27.787 --> 00:03:31.249
But that boy had many adventures
with this box over the years.

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:33.334
Once, it was his time machine

00:03:33.376 --> 00:03:36.337
that took him back
to the age of the dinosaurs.

00:03:36.379 --> 00:03:37.505
(Dinosaur screeching)

00:03:37.546 --> 00:03:38.714
Oh!

00:03:38.756 --> 00:03:42.843
Another time it was actually his bunker
to hide from the zombie apocalypse.

00:03:42.843 --> 00:03:45.096
(Screaming)

00:03:45.596 --> 00:03:48.266
And once he even dreamed
that it was a submarine

00:03:48.307 --> 00:03:50.434
that took him to the depths of the ocean

00:03:50.476 --> 00:03:52.520
until he could no longer hold his breath.

00:03:52.561 --> 00:03:54.730
(Water splashing)

00:03:55.314 --> 00:03:57.483
But one day, the boy
couldn't find the box.

00:03:57.525 --> 00:03:58.901
He looked in his room.

00:03:58.901 --> 00:04:00.611
He searched the backyard.